        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Papp\n- Organizations: New York Shakespeare Festival, Public Theater\n- Events: Shakespeare in the Park\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Papp was born on June 22, 1921, and he was an American theatrical producer and director.\n- Joseph Papp died on October 31, 1991.\n- Shakespeare in the Park in New York City was originally branded as the New York Shakespeare Festival under the direction of Joseph Papp.\n- The Public Theater renamed the institution in 2002 as part of a larger reorganization.",
